#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.groupby.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.groupby"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:1 of
msgid "Group the LiteFrame by one or more columns."
msgstr "按一列或多列对 LiteFrame 进行分组。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.groupby.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:3 of
msgid "Column name(s) to group by."
msgstr "用于分组的列名。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:5 of
msgid "Whether to sort group keys in the result."
msgstr "是否在结果中对分组键进行排序。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:7 of
msgid ""
"If True, rows with null group keys are dropped before aggregation. If "
"False, null-key rows are included as a separate group."
msgstr ""
"如果为 True，在聚合前会删除具有空分组键的行。如果为 False，空键行会被包含"
"为一个单独的组。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:10 of
msgid ""
"Whether ``apply`` / ``apply_chunk`` results include the grouping key "
"columns.  ``True`` (default) prepends keys the UDF did not return (pandas"
" ``group_keys=True`` + ``reset_index()`` shape); ``False`` omits them.  "
"Has no effect on ``agg``, ``transform``, or the window family — matching "
"pandas."
msgstr ""
"``apply`` / ``apply_chunk`` 结果是否包含分组键列。``True``（默认）会在 "
"UDF 未返回的键前面添加（pandas ``group_keys=True`` + ``reset_index()`` "
"形状）；``False`` 则省略它们。对 ``agg``、``transform`` 或窗口族没有影响—"
"—与 pandas 匹配。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.groupby.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:17 of
msgid ""
"An intermediate object supporting ``.agg()`` and shortcut methods like "
"``.sum()``, ``.mean()``, etc."
msgstr "支持 ``.agg()`` 和快捷方法如 ``.sum()``、``.mean()`` 等的中间对象。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.groupby.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.groupby.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:21 of
msgid "If ``sort=True`` is passed."
msgstr "如果传递了 ``sort=True``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:25 of
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.agg`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:26 of
msgid "Aggregate using one or more operations over columns."
msgstr "使用一个或多个操作对列进行聚合。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:28 of
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.sort`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.groupby.groupby:29 of
msgid "Sort the LiteFrame by columns."
msgstr "按列对 LiteFrame 进行排序。"

